<title>USA: Citizens First intent on buying stock.</title>
<headline>Citizens First intent on buying stock.</headline>
<dateline>NORMAL, Ill. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citizens First Financial Corp, holding company of Citizens Savings Bank FSB, said Tuesday its board authorized management to apply to the office of Thrift Supervision for approval to buy up to 10 percent of the company's outstanding stock.</p>
<p>The application is expected to be filed shortly, the company said.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
